    "answer": {
      "short": "$x = 0.5$",
      "worked": "Combine matching bases and write $81=3^4$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}3^{2x+3}&=3^4 \\\\ 2x+3&=4 \\\\ 2x&=1 \\\\ x&=\\frac12=0.5\\end{align*}$$",
